{
  "info": {
    "name": "Leave Management Gateway",
    "description": "Full positive and negative gateway tests (A–E matrix in POSTMAN-TEST-CASES.md).\n\nDocker (recommended):\n1. docker compose up (from project root — see DOCKER.md)\n2. baseUrl = http://localhost:8000, Eureka = http://localhost:8761\n\nLocal alternative:\n1. Eureka: cd eureka-server && mvn spring-boot:run\n2. Start Employee 8002, Auth 8001, Leave 8003, Notification 8004, Gateway 8000\n\nRun folder 01 - Login first (sets tokens), then 02 → 05.\nRestart leave-service before folder 05 for fresh seed leaves.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8000" },
    { "key": "employee_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "manager_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "admin_token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Login (run first)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POS - Login as employee (john)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Has access_token', () => pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.test('Token type Bearer', () => pm.expect(json.token_type).to.eql('Bearer'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('employee_token', json.access_token);",
                  "pm.test('Employee id is 101', () => pm.expect(json.employee.id).to.eql(101));",
                  "pm.test('Role employee', () => pm.expect(json.employee.role).to.eql('employee'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"john\",\n  \"password\": \"john123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POS - Login as manager (manager_eng)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('manager_token', json.access_token);",
                  "pm.test('Employee id is 201', () => pm.expect(json.employee.id).to.eql(201));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"manager_eng\",\n  \"password\": \"manager123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
